@startuml
skinparam {
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ControlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  EntityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ActorBorderColor black
  BoundaryBorderColor black
  ControlBorderColor black
  EntityBorderColor black
  DatabaseBorderColor black
}

actor User
boundary "Home / Story Page" as UI
boundary Router
control MangaController as MC
control MangaService as MS
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open story list
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/manga/get/all?page=1&limit=24
activate Router

Router -> MC: 3. getAll(page, limit)
activate MC
MC -> MC: 4. Parse + clamp page/limit

MC -> MS: 5. getAllManga(p, l)
activate MS
MS -> MS: 6. Build aggregation pipeline
MS -> MongoDB: 7. aggregate(pipeline)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MS: 8. {data,total}
deactivate MongoDB

MS --> MC: 9. return {data,total}
deactivate MS
MC --> Router: 10. HTTP 200 {data,total,page,limit}
deactivate MC

Router --> UI: 11. Render story cards
deactivate Router
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml